Sofie,

See below from Pieter Jansen. He also called me at 08:30 this morning and he wasn't shouting, which is worse.

Two things I need from you today, ideally before 15:00 because I promised to call him back with a date:

1. Why did we top it up in February? I've looked at 00041055 and it says 2.5 kg topped up, no leak found. If there was =
no leak, where did 2.5 kg go? I need to understand what we did before I explain it to the customer. Not to blame anyone=
, I just don't want to tell Pieter something that turns out to be wrong next week.

2. Who can go. Jakub was there yesterday (00044102), 1.9 bar on circuit 2, and he did the right thing by not touching i=
t, but he can't do the work and his exam isn't until November. Marco is compressors only. So unless I borrow someone fr=
om Gdansk, that's you.

Also, is this the Nordkyl valve thing? I have a vague memory of a bulletin last year.

Thanks,
Lena

